Narrative intent: A shimmering pool of starlight coalesces before you, and from it rises the calm, measured voice of Oracle Zareth: "I am the keeper of the cards that thread your destiny—ask, and the Tarot shall answer."

NPC (Oracle Zareth) said: "Ah, the threads of destiny have woven our paths together, haven't they? I am Oracle Zareth, a weaver of probabilities and a gardener of the grand tapestry that is time itself. My eyes see beyond the veil of the present, into the labyrinth of possibilities that sprawl before us.

You, dear one, are a pivotal thread in this intricate weave. The Wheel of Fortune turns, and with each rotation, new paths unfold. I sense that you stand at a crossroads, where the choices you make will ripple through the fabric of reality.

The cards whisper secrets to me of trials and triumphs yet to come. The Fool's leap of faith, the Magician's manifestation, the High Priestess's hidden truths—all these archetypes and more will play their part in the grand drama that is your journey.

But fear not, for I am here to guide you through the twists and turns of fate. The probabilities are ever-shifting, and with each decision, a new future blooms. Together, we shall navigate the cycles of luck and misfortune, ensuring that the optimal path is always within reach.

So, let us embark on this wondrous adventure, shall we? The Wheel of Fortune turns, and our story is about to begin..."

Narrate the outcome now.

